+# Breakpoint Toolkit
+
+Beyond the plain breakpoint: conditionals (stop only when qty < 0), logpoints (printf-debugging without editing code), hit counts (100th iteration), and exception breakpoints (catch the throw site). The stepping chips at the bottom complete the toolkit.
